DEMON: First day on the job?
DEMON: Heh, you're toast.

ANGEL: Now, now, have a little faith in them!
ANGEL: It's a relatively simple job.
ANGEL: All you have to do is listen to their pleas for mercy,
ANGEL: and weigh their virtues against their sins.
ANGEL: If you view them favorably, raise them up to Heaven. 
ANGEL: If not..

DEMON: DRAG THEM DOWN TO HELL. HAHAHA.

ANGEL: IF that seems like a big responsibility...

DEMON: It is!

ANGEL: But, like, no pressure.
ANGEL: :)
ANGEL: Oh, and by the way, if you ever need council on your decsions... 

DEMON: They can't hear us.

